==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
[[Image:Uk-grable2.jpg|right|thumb|A closeup of the fireball and mushroom cloud from the Upshot-Knothole Grable atomic bomb.]]
{{en-noun|head=[[mushroom]] [[cloud]]}}

# A large cloud of [[smoke]], [[flame]] and [[debris]] that [[rise]]s into the [[sky]] as a result of a large [[explosion]], especially after a [[nuclear]] explosion, characterized by a long shaft rising from the ground into a much larger or more spread out top, reminiscent of a mushroom in shape.

